# Exposed provider keys / research spec — never commit
deep.md

# The blanket `*.json` rule above silently swallowed package.json and
# tsconfig.json for apps/dialer-v2, so that package never existed on the
# remote at all. `pnpm --filter` exits 0 when nothing matches, so CI reported
# success while running zero tests. Config files that define a workspace must
# never be ignorable.
!**/package.json
!**/tsconfig*.json
!**/vitest.config.json
